        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Lace drawn work. Ground: linen and pink cotton, with threads drawn in both directions. Designs: zig-zags and lozenges with radiating lines darned in white linen on rectangular mesh ground whipped over with reddish orange, neutral yellow, greenish yellow, and black silk and a little blue cotton. Pink and white chequed cloth shows at each end."@en ;
